```{=html}
<div class="post-rows">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
  <article class="post-row">
    <p class="post-row-date"><%= item.date %></p>
    <div class="post-row-body">
      <h3 class="post-row-title"><a href="<%- item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a></h3>
      <% if (item.description) { %><p class="post-row-desc"><%= item.description %></p><% } %>
      <p class="post-row-meta">
        <% if (item.track && item.order) { %><span><%= item.track %> · Part <%= item.order %></span><% } %>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
<% } %>
</div>
```
